{"unit_id":"oxmumu3__ai-twin-starter#card-zh","repo":"oxmumu3/ai-twin-starter","commit":"bcdc0b21746d2e06ee1d93c240fef3e5ed38f950","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Agent Twin 是面向 DSH Web 的 AI 分身工作台与工具插件。它注册 agent_twin 工具，并可挂载原生页面，帮助用户盘点和整理项目材料、从有出处的来源蒸馏知识与工作流、管理能力候选及本地日报，并配置 Slack 通道和身份权限。适合希望把项目资料整理成可维护分身能力并在授权范围内管理消息工作流的用户；Slack 操作需本地配置授权，原生服务须由所有者单独启用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-20","index.js:105-180","src/native-plugin.mjs:1-18"]}
{"unit_id":"oxmumu3__ai-twin-starter#card-en","repo":"oxmumu3/ai-twin-starter","commit":"bcdc0b21746d2e06ee1d93c240fef3e5ed38f950","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Agent Twin is a DSH Web workbench for organizing project materials, distilling source-backed knowledge and workflows, managing capability candidates, and configuring authorized Slack workflows.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-20","index.js:105-180","src/native-plugin.mjs:1-18"]}
