{"unit_id":"oxmumu3__ai-twin-starter#feature-2","repo":"oxmumu3/ai-twin-starter","commit":"bcdc0b21746d2e06ee1d93c240fef3e5ed38f950","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Agent Twin 的功能「来源蒸馏」：从用户选定的文本来源准备批次，整理知识、判断、工作流或工具卡并保留来源引用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:96-100","src/distill.mjs:1-140"]}
